<title>SPAIN: Repsol ends at new high amid share sale.</title>
<headline>Repsol ends at new high amid share sale.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Spanish energy group Repsol SA closed up 30 pesetas to 6,300 on Friday amid the privatisation of the government's last 10.0 percent stake in the firm this month.</p>
<p>Demand for the retail tranche, for which provisional orders can be made until Monday, was 30 times the number of shares on offer at the close of business yesterday, auguring well for the sale, dealers said. Repsol saw trading volume of over two million shares.</p>
<p>The privatisation process ends on April 29.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
